#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "The Veloura Lite delivers a modern solution for professionals who want to build visually striking websites with speed and precision. Designed for advanced Web design, UI design, and UX design, this theme helps you create a refined website layout using powerful design blocks, FSE blocks, and flexible WordPress blocks. With ready-made block patterns, it works as a complete website builder that supports true no-code design, making it ideal for both developers and non-technical users. This multipurpose theme features a minimal, elegant, and sophisticated look that suits a creative agency website, portfolio website, or any agency-friendly project. It's clean, and beautiful visuals appear sharp on all screens, thanks to a responsive, mobile-friendly, and Retina-ready structure. The theme uses optimized code, clean code, and secure and clean code to ensure faster page load time and reliable performance. The Veloura Lite includes pre-built sections, such as a bold Banner, Team showcase, testimonial section, and an engaging call-to-action button (CTA) to boost conversions. Integrated social media elements help increase reach, while interactive, stunning, and animated effects enhance user engagement. Built with Bootstrap support, useful shortcodes, and extensive Customization Options, it allows deep personalization without complexity. Developers appreciate its modern structure, while businesses value its Luxurious finish and practical personalization options. The theme remains user-friendly, translation-ready, and highly responsive, making it perfect for global audiences. Overall, the Veloura Lite empowers you to build a beautiful, high-performing website with complete creative freedom."
msgstr ""

